    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Warlocks that study affliction become masters of shadowtouched powers, unlike priests of the shadow priesthood, warlocks delight in the use of fel as a force to cause pain and leaving their enemies in whirls of torment.</p><h2>Expanded Spell List</h2><p>Your area of study lets you choose from an expanded list of spells when you learn a warlock spell. The following spells are added to the warlock spell list for you.</p><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"50\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Spell Level</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Spells</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"50\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1st</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.T3SBcFNt14IJ80xe]{Dark Void}, Dissonant Whispers</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"50\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2nd</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.zwGsAv6kmwzYGhh3]{Blindness/Deafness}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.uHjhQucQy3YR2Wnk]{Mind Flay}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"50\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.yqUDoxk4x0NWG5Bz]{Slow}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.TwlD4PLcltv7Xh7j]{Stinking Cloud}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"50\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.9hQXdMSmerkTsHDe]{Confusion}, Elemental Bane</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"50\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.LkvI11Uue774QBKZ]{Cloudkill}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.CjIq8Ed7bu3vVwT1]{Contagion}</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
